        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/azqa/{size}/2015_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-12-31T15:06:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Amnachaidh\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/ba8739/48.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Amnachaidh:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Loved \"Velveteen vs. the Junior Super Patriots\", but \"…vs the Multiverse\" hit every cylinder.Also, black.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yeah, she really did an outstanding job with those books. &nbsp;I'm curious to see if she writes anything about Vel's further adventures in Halloween and Winter, though I rather doubt it.</p>",
